# Q36 If an assistant asks for "the crack", which measure is official, and which nearby ones are not it?
PREFIX kpi: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/kpi/>
PREFIX kind: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/kpi/measure-kind/>
PREFIX measure: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/kpi/measure/>
PREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>
SELECT ?official ?nearby WHERE {
  ?official a kpi:MeasureDefinition ; skos:altLabel "the crack"@en ; kpi:notToBeConfusedWith ?nearby .
}
